# export_presets.cfg is intentionally tracked (not ignored) -- the GitHub Actions build
# pipeline (.github/workflows/build_installer.yml) needs the committed "Windows Desktop"
# preset to run `godot --export-release`. No secrets in it (codesign is disabled).

